{
  "id": "2CH.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Malagho Gha Ngelo 11",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wulodi ghwa Shemaia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Rehoboamu wacha Jerusalemu, ukawikwanya wandu wa Juda na Benjamini, wandu elfu ighana na mirongo wunyanya wisaghulo mang'oni gha wuda, wiendelwa na wandu wa Israeli, wipate kughuwunja wuzuri kwa Rehoboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela BWANA ukaghora na Shemaia mundu wa Mlungu ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mzere Rehoboamu mwana wa Solomoni mzuri wa Juda, na wandu wose wa Israeli wiko isanga ja Juda na ja Benjamini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kukaia ini BWANA naghora huwu: ‘Msejoke kulwa na wanyinyu. Kula mundu ughale mzinyi kwake, angu iji ilagho jaafuma kwapo.’” Niko wikasikira seji BWANA ughambie, wikawuya hata ndewicheghenda kulwa na Jeroboamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu kuagha mizi ya ngome",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu orekoghe ukikaia Jerusalemu, ukaagha mizi ekulindia andenyi ya Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukaagha Bethlehemu, Etamu, Tekoa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beth-suri, Soko, Adulamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gathi, Maresha, Zifu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoraimu, Lakishi, Azeka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sora, Aijaloni, na Hebroni nayo ni mizi ya ngome iko andenyi ya Juda na Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oreriaghieghe ngome rimange nandighi, ukawika vilongozi andenyi, na vindo, mavuda na divei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawika ngao na mafumu mizi yose na kuibonya ikaie na ndighi loli loli. Kwa huwo oochawadia Juda na Benjamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wakohani na Walawi kucha Juda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wakohani na Walawi wikafuma andu kose kwa Israeli, wikamghendia Rehoboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walawi weresighieghe masanga ghawo na mali rawo wikacha Juda, kwa kukaia Jeroboamu na wana wake werewighirieghe wisedumike sa wakohani wa BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawika wakohani wake moni wedumika andu kotasira mighondinyi, na kudumikia majini, na fwana ya ngache oreibonyereghe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Waz. 12.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wandu wifumie vichuku vose va Israeli, awo werekoghe na ngolo emlola BWANA Mlungu wa Israeli, wikanughana na Walawi cha Jerusalemu, wipate kumfunyira BWANA kizongona, uo Mlungu wa weke ndee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikaghubonya wuzuri ghwa Juda ghukaie na ndighi, na kwa miaka idadu wikam'bonya Rehoboamu mwana wa Solomoni kukaia na wulindiri ghukate, angu kwa miaka idadu werenughieghe seji Daudi na Solomoni werekoghe wikibonya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyumba ya Rehoboamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu orelowueghe Mahalathi mwai wa Jerimothi wawae Daudi, na mae orekoghe Abihaili mwai wa Eliabu wawae Jese; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawo wikava wana wa womi; Jeushi, Shemaria, na Zahamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyuma ukalowua Maaka mwai wa Absalomu; wikava Abija, Atai, Ziza, na Shelomithi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu ukamkunda Maaka mwai wa Absalomu kuchumba waka wake wose na waka wake wekanya wose (orelowueghe waka ikumi na wunyanya, na waka wekanya mirongo irandadu; ukava wana mirongo iwi na wunyanya wa womi, na wa waka mirongo irandadu). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu ukammbika Abija mwana wa Maaka ukaie m'baa aghadi ya waruna, angu orekundieghe um'bonye mzuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu ukabonya malagho kwa hikima; ukawineka wana wake wamu kazi mizinyi yose ja Juda na Benjamini, andenyi ya iyo mizi yose erekoghe na ngome. Ukawineka vindo vingi, na kuwilolia waka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
